---
title: role.immoralist.follow-immediately=false で背徳者の後追いは翌朝発動 (= night_kill 扱い)
setup: { immoralist: 1, werehamster: 1, werewolf: 1, villager: 2 }
rules:
  role.immoralist.follow-immediately: false
  general.first-victim: none
---
# Day 2 で Bob (妖狐) 処刑 → 狐陣営全滅 → Alice (背徳者) を pending、 Day 2 内では死なない。
# Night 1 を経て Day 3 朝に Alice が night_kill として死亡。

++Alice、Bob、Carol、Dave、Eve
!Alice=背徳者
!Bob=妖狐
!Carol=人狼
!Dave=村人
!Eve=村人

# == engine: Night 0 (state.day=1) ==
# peace
# == end ==

Alice→Bob
Carol→Bob
Dave→Bob
Eve→Bob
Bob→Alice

# == engine: Day 2 (state.day=2) ==
# Bob 4 / Alice 1 → execution=Bob → Alice pending (Day 2 内死亡せず)
# == end ==
# == engine: Night 1 (state.day=3) ==
# peace + pending follow 発動 → night_kill: Alice
# == end ==

# @expect-status Bob: dead
# @expect-status Alice: dead
# @expect-cause Alice: night_kill
